viR6vsCf2W9VSJhg1tsT.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-14\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Glass Gun\",\"overview\":\"A new incident shakes West Dean. As the surrealist artists begin to suspect one another, Scotland Yard's investigation starts to focus on a single guest. Paranoia spreads, secrets unravel, and new facts about Sheila's past come to light.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AujX6AZWVFxcs1qNXTc9dBhwk1o.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-21\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Lobster Telephone\",\"overview\":\"The guests hold a beautiful farewell, while Scotland Yard discovers who will receive a surprising inheritance. Magritte starts his own search for the truth, and new suspects begin to emerge on the estate.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7B6CZcmqo8PEWNWU5StUatagToL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-28\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Phantom Lady\",\"overview\":\"New guests arrive at West Dean, bringing tension and poor manners. As Quant and Thistlethwaite race to connect dots, a masked figure with a face of roses emerges from the shadows. Suspicion grows. Is it a warning - or something dangerous?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/htwwlXtg6I773BDTTF3cCshQYOY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-04\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Gift\",\"overview\":\"Another disappearance? Tension peaks as the exhibition countdown begins. The estate reopens, the gala begins. Lord James' elite guests Picasso, Guggenheim, Freud arrive, ready to turn surrealism into gold. Champagne, whispers, and a twist.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yRRN5l6Sz6YRjmbDAsIDuxZrHBI.jpg\",\"rating\":1,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-11\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Survivor\",\"overview\":\"It's opening night. The world's most extravagant art lovers gather, ready to turn surrealism into gold. But as the gala begins, the night takes an unexpected turn and secrets are revealed. Will our artists finally become world-famous?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fm7DAaOyHijabOW2AWalAd3Uf05.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-18\",\"runtime\":53}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-08-14\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}